{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FTsEpc7XizzK7Zz3BVC6jD","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# PENILAIAN PENGETAHUAN / KNOWLEDGE ASSESSMENT\n2\t\n3\t**Kod / Code:** S960-002-3:2020-C01/KA\n4\t**Competency Unit:** C01 — Body Consultation / Konsultasi Badan\n5\t**Paper Colour / Warna Kertas:** PINK / MERAH JAMBU\n6\t**Duration / Tempoh:** 1 Hour / 1 Jam\n7\t**Total Marks / Jumlah Markah:** 100\n8\t\n9\t---\n10\t\n11\t## Instructions (Arahan)\n12\t\n13\t1. This paper contains FOUR (4) sections.\n14\t2. Answer ALL questions in ALL sections.\n15\t3. Write your answers clearly and legibly.\n16\t4. Marks are allocated as shown for each question.\n17\t\n18\t---\n19\t\n20\t## Section A: Multiple Choice (20 marks)\n21\t\n22\tChoose the BEST answer for each question. Each question carries 2 marks.\n23\t\n24\t**1.** Which body type is characterised by a lean build, long limbs, narrow shoulders and fast metabolism?\n25\t\n26\tA. Endomorph\n27\tB. Mesomorph\n28\tC. Ectomorph\n29\tD. Andromorph\n30\t\n31\t**2.** The autoclave sterilises tools using:\n32\t\n33\tA. Ultraviolet light at room temperature\n34\tB. Steam under pressure at 121 C and 15 psi\n35\tC. Dry heat at 100 C\n36\tD. Chemical solution at room temperature\n37\t\n38\t**3.** Which of the following is an ABSOLUTE contraindication for body treatments?\n39\t\n40\tA. Varicose veins\n41\tB. High blood pressure\n42\tC. Contagious skin disease\n43\tD. Pregnancy\n44\t\n45\t**4.** The Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA) in Malaysia was enacted in:\n46\t\n47\tA. 2005\n48\tB. 2008\n49\tC. 2010\n50\tD. 2015\n51\t\n52\t**5.** FIFO in stock management stands for:\n53\t\n54\tA. Final Inventory For Operations\n55\tB. First-In, First-Out\n56\tC. Fixed Inventory, Flexible Output\n57\tD. First Inspection, Final Order\n58\t\n59\t**6.** The Asian BMI classification for \"Overweight\" is:\n60\t\n61\tA. 18.5 - 22.9\n62\tB. 23.0 - 24.9\n63\tC. 25.0 - 29.9\n64\tD. 30.0 and above\n65\t\n66\t**7.** Which postural deviation involves excessive outward curvature of the thoracic spine?\n67\t\n68\tA. Lordosis\n69\tB. Scoliosis\n70\tC. Kyphosis\n71\tD. Flat back\n72\t\n73\t**8.** Grade 2 cellulite is characterised by:\n74\t\n75\tA. Dimpling visible only when skin is pinched\n76\tB. Dimpling visible when standing but not lying\n77\tC. Dimpling visible both standing and lying\n78\tD. No dimpling under any circumstances\n79\t\n80\t**9.** Clinical waste in a salon must be disposed of in:"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"38d40458-baa8-4393-bba6-011dc113a3b2","uuid":"3fad9849-4b0f-43c9-8554-263dce8c488b","timestamp":"2026-04-16T14:38:43.014Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/Users/Jyue/Documents/1-projects/noss-to-wim/aesthetic-services/C01/KA.md","content":"# PENILAIAN PENGETAHUAN / KNOWLEDGE ASSESSMENT\n\n**Kod / Code:** S960-002-3:2020-C01/KA\n**Competency Unit:** C01 — Body Consultation / Konsultasi Badan\n**Paper Colour / Warna Kertas:** PINK / MERAH JAMBU\n**Duration / Tempoh:** 1 Hour / 1 Jam\n**Total Marks / Jumlah Markah:** 100\n\n---\n\n## Instructions (Arahan)\n\n1. This paper contains FOUR (4) sections.\n2. Answer ALL questions in ALL sections.\n3. Write your answers clearly and legibly.\n4. Marks are allocated as shown for each question.\n\n---\n\n## Section A: Multiple Choice (20 marks)\n\nChoose the BEST answer for each question. Each question carries 2 marks.\n\n**1.** Which body type is characterised by a lean build, long limbs, narrow shoulders and fast metabolism?\n\nA. Endomorph\nB. Mesomorph\nC. Ectomorph\nD. Andromorph\n\n**2.** The autoclave sterilises tools using:\n\nA. Ultraviolet light at room temperature\nB. Steam under pressure at 121 C and 15 psi\nC. Dry heat at 100 C\nD. Chemical solution at room temperature\n\n**3.** Which of the following is an ABSOLUTE contraindication for body treatments?\n\nA. Varicose veins\nB. High blood pressure\nC. Contagious skin disease\nD. Pregnancy\n\n**4.** The Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA) in Malaysia was enacted in:\n\nA. 2005\nB. 2008\nC. 2010\nD. 2015\n\n**5.** FIFO in stock management stands for:\n\nA. Final Inventory For Operations\nB. First-In, First-Out\nC. Fixed Inventory, Flexible Output\nD. First Inspection, Final Order\n\n**6.** The Asian BMI classification for \"Overweight\" is:\n\nA. 18.5 - 22.9\nB. 23.0 - 24.9\nC. 25.0 - 29.9\nD. 30.0 and above\n\n**7.** Which postural deviation involves excessive outward curvature of the thoracic spine?\n\nA. Lordosis\nB. Scoliosis\nC. Kyphosis\nD. Flat back\n\n**8.** Grade 2 cellulite is characterised by:\n\nA. Dimpling visible only when skin is pinched\nB. Dimpling visible when standing but not lying\nC. Dimpling visible both standing and lying\nD. No dimpling under any circumstances\n\n**9.** Clinical waste in a salon must be disposed of in:","numLines":80,"startLine":1,"totalLines":200}}}
